3. **Use sx prop over styled** (for one-off styles)
```javascript
// ✅ Simple, performant for one-off
<Box sx={{ color: 'red' }}>Text</Box>

// ✅ Better for reused, complex styles
const StyledBox = styled(Box)(({ theme }) => ({...}));
